# Tags (docs/sanmaime.md §5.8). run.js checks that `playwright test --grep @smoke` runs exactly
# these tests, that `nimaime-gen export --tags @smoke` lists them, and the condition checks $tags.
@smoke
Screen: Tagged Login

  Element: Login Form
    Show: Email address

  @tagged
  Element: Login Button
    @uses-tags
    When: The tags are known
    Disable
